": "琉叶先生、こんにちは！\n前回の漫画は本当にありがとうございました。納品していただいた作品がとても嬉しくて、すごく気に入っています…！\nそのため、今回もぜひもう一件ご依頼させていただきたく思い、リクエストいたしました。\n私はあなたの白黒漫画スタイルが大好きです。白黒漫画スタイルでこの二人を描いてもいいですか？\n彼らは仲の良い兄妹で、お互いにとって非常に重要です。兄は落ち着いて内向的で、妹は明るく活発だ。\n詳細：https://tropical-scale-170.notion.site/1dc1f03558ff8096956eca1a6fa6f9b9\n服装は自由に選べます！服装を変更しても全く問題ありません！雰囲気は完全にリラックスしたものにしてください！自由に独自のコンテンツを作成してください。\nもし没ラフや下書きがあれば、それを見ることができると嬉しいです。\n使用用途個人用のみ、宛名は「YuKiKo」でお願いします。レイヤー分けされたPSDファイルがあれば幸いです。\n\nもし金額が足りない場合は、訂正をお願いします。難しければ直接キャンセルしていただいても構いません。\n\n今回も誠に感謝しております！\n\nhttps://tropical-scale-170.notion.site/1dc1f03558ff8096956eca1a6fa6f9b9", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mikaduki1224/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3927844, "client_id": 211848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a785f83013389b1ff5940227ca42589e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a785f83013389b1ff5940227ca42589e, https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5e66e99eee358556e0457c9e18d2d8b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71c94f38bdbddf1521264afdf3c6f239 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c9afb2b615482d07fff7059260c3848", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c9afb2b615482d07fff7059260c3848, https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c270fec76ed20569fee88e8e5a7adc34 2x, https://si.imgix.net/11310acd/uploads/origins/8342e8a1-5a85-4a53-a465-30f15bb30f98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=807fbe36b02b92215857fd1cd39bae8a 3x"}, "body": "Hello! The way you draw women is so lovely! I especially like the piece on your social media that has the fingers in the mouth! I'd like to request art of my child, <Maya>!\n\nsta.sh/0j0seb6dk0s\nPlease access the character images from the URL above\n\nShe is a fairy who works as an idol. She is always happy and smiling, but she forces herself to be to hide her chaotic, fairy urges. Her laughter sometimes sounds like a threat. She has a secret boyfriend she is obsessive over, being a possessive yandere with a violent streak.\n\nI'd like for her to be wearing her fairy clothes (the first image in the link with the leotard), with her wings out and maskless. Other than that, I leave the scene and composition up to you!\n\nIf possible, please deliver a PSD file with the sign layer separate from the illustration. Thanks, have a good day!", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mikaduki1224/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3927844, "client_id": 53759, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ddd05028f14d818c8d1986305981cf1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ddd05028f14d818c8d1986305981cf1, https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e05746843d45719f0a4e901cd016a69c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40faf9f62cfe23dd3975bd6b66fad993 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb401a652bb95456a8a8571ba3e418b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb401a652bb95456a8a8571ba3e418b1, https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6c6dfc71d0ef1b6b7cbafebec6a6cca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e89cbc1/uploads/origins/f6134db2-01ca-4fcc-8b9c-5fec16101a1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e76eae1a9668d2b7b782954586fdaadf 3x"}, "body": "琉叶さん, thank you very much for the illustration. I really like the vibrant colors and the sense of movement in the pose! If it's okay, may I request another illustration?\n\nThis time I would be happy if I could make a request for an illustration for my character <Estelle>.\n\nEstelle: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/216wkio0653j\n\nPlease view the character references from the URL above.\n\nPlease color the sclera of her eyes black, not white. She is a girl with a sociable personality but gives off an air of being sinister. She has the features of a spider.\n\nI toggled \"NSFW\" on in the settings, and I'd be happy if a suggestive, sexy illustration without too much exposure could be drawn. I'll leave the composition up to you. Thank you very much for your consideration.", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mikaduki1224/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3927844, "client_id": 53759, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ece87b992ce5a8e565ad0fb9ac5b88c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ece87b992ce5a8e565ad0fb9ac5b88c, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=539faa17f9a6f6ef0265666c4244bd5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd2b2d0117e16f0d7090fa84a769d3ec 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aa5c32a0c30e8df45f7b98ae2b8ce72d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aa5c32a0c30e8df45f7b98ae2b8ce72d, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e9eafa5678d7f384e17c19912a498732 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8408363b/uploads/origins/138b00e0-d913-46d3-8696-f5073447877e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d40e2ecb820fe966fec2c5ffae7139b6 3x"}, "body": "るかさん,  it’s nice to meet you. Thank you for the appeal. I apologize for taking a while to reply. I did not check Skeb for a while. I really like ルカさん’s art style and the way both male and female characters are drawn. In particular, I really like the cool girls…! \nI’d be happy if I could request an illustration of my character <Ariel>.\n\nAriel: https://toyhou.se/32794094.oc-refs/32794370.ariel-aviyt/gallery?key=NsBT00XX6lVhAcI  \n\nPlease choose the outfit you prefer from the URL above. Ariel is a cute and cheerful girl with a sly and calculating side. \n\nI’d be happy if るかさん could draw an illustration that portrays the gap between her cute appearance and her calculating nature. Or, something like making a gun with her fingers like “bang!” It’s also fine to draw her freely from your imagination. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 222940, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "キドリ", "screen_name": "yau5531", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fwebpublic-ee31f795-7549-436b-ae2c-7f278bc43ba8.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/webpublic-7562ddf5-0e95-4214-9ebc-89cf4ca1edb8.png", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 1721641, "creator": tru